# sent_id = Costa1909:2:25:63
# text_orig = Upainhen mira ucikiê çui, u-iauau ana, aîtá u-munhan curuçá rangaua, aîtá u-nheen i-xupé: — Re-çú putari Iurupari piri, re-cúim.
